  <entity00401731:DescriptionOfStockPurchaseContractsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_DerivativesTypeAxis_ifrs-full_OptionContractMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_entity00401731_CybellumTechnologiesLtdOfEntitysTotalForSubsidiariesMemberOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간말 현재 연결회사가 Cybellum Technologies Ltd.의 Stock Option이 부여된직원에 대한 Put Option 부여에 따라 파생상품부채 3,489백만원을 인식하였고, 2025년 1분기 중 동 계약에 대한 파생상품거래손익은 없습니다.</entity00401731:DescriptionOfStockPurchaseContractsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfStockPurchaseContractsTableOfItems>
